@startuml
title Aveli — Integration Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6E7781
  LifeLineBorderColor #30363D
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #30363D
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantFontColor #0D1117
}

actor User

participant "Aveli Mobile App" as App
participant "Secure Storage" as Secure
participant "Aveli Backend" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RevenueCat" as RC
participant "Google Play / App Store" as Store

== Authentication ==

User -> App : Register / Sign in
App -> API : Auth request
API -> DB : Validate / create account
DB --> API : Account state

alt New account
  API -> DB : Create 30-day trial
end

API --> App : Session tokens
App -> Secure : Persist tokens

== Access Resolution ==

App -> API : GET /v1/access
API -> DB : Load grants / trial / subscription
DB --> API : Access-related state

API -> API : Resolve effective access source
API --> App : AccessState

App -> Secure : Persist access snapshot

alt Access granted
  App --> User : Open Workspace
else Access denied
  App --> User : Open Access Gate
end

== Purchase ==

User -> App : Select subscription
App -> RC : Start purchase
RC -> Store : Open store purchase flow
Store --> RC : Purchase result
RC --> App : CustomerInfo

App -> API : POST /v1/billing/sync
API -> RC : Verify current entitlement
RC --> API : Subscription / entitlement state

API -> DB : Update normalized subscription
DB --> API : Updated state

API -> API : Recalculate access
API --> App : Updated AccessState

alt Access granted
  App -> Secure : Update access snapshot
  App --> User : Open Workspace
else Access denied
  App --> User : Keep Access Gate
end

== RevenueCat Webhook ==

RC -> API : POST /v1/webhooks/revenuecat
API -> DB : Update subscription state
API -> API : Recalculate entitlement

note right of API
Webhook handling does not
depend on the mobile app
being open.
end note

== Restore Purchase ==

User -> App : Restore purchase
App -> RC : Restore purchases
RC -> Store : Query store state
Store --> RC : Existing subscriptions
RC --> App : CustomerInfo

App -> API : POST /v1/billing/sync
API -> RC : Verify entitlement
RC --> API : Current state

API -> DB : Reconcile subscription
API -> API : Resolve access
API --> App : AccessState

== Offline Launch ==

User -> App : Launch without network
App -> Secure : Load session + access snapshot
Secure --> App : Cached state

App -> App : Evaluate offline grace

alt Snapshot trusted
  App --> User : Open Workspace
else Verification required
  App --> User : Access verification required
end

@enduml